 solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-7(0)+10 \\\\ y & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(0,10).$" 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186094136 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186094137 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186094138 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186094139 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186094140 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186094135 1075 17592186523400 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186094135 1075 17592186523499 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186094135 1075 17592186523538 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186094135 1075 17592186523566 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186094135 1075 17592186523602 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186094135 1078 17592186523538 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1075 17592186095959 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186095958 1075 17592186095960 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186095958 1075 17592186095961 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186095958 1075 17592186095962 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186095958 1075 17592186095963 13194139535619 17592186045417 false] [17592186095958 1075 17592186523282 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1075 17592186523321 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1075 17592186523489 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1075 17592186523591 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1075 17592186523651 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186095958 1078 17592186523282 13194139535619 17592186045417 true] [17592186096486 1071 "![](images/24/2420154d44b786c6aad54212760e9a37ce67dbdce94a7043039f0e824c5ef9bc.png)\n\nIn parallelogram $ABCD$ shown above, which of the following equalities are true?\n\n- $\\overrightarrow{CB}+\\overrightarrow{BA}=\